  "title": "Bank Business News: Why Banks Need to Rethink Data Strategy for the AI Era",
  "summary": "The following article was published by Bank Business News.Why Banks Need to Rethink Data Strategy for the AI Era. By Maha Sivara. For years, many banks have viewed their data strategy through the lens of a technology initiative, focusing on areas such as cloud migrations, data lakes, tech stacks and platform connections. These investments certainly matter, but the real purpose of a data strategy should be improving decision making and driving measurable business outcomes.",
